In [[outpost]]s, [[Kurzick Merchant]]s provide discounted items for members of an [[alliance]] who have control over the outpost they are in. In [[explorable area]]s, these [[merchant]]s only provide services to players who have more unspent [[Kurzick faction]] points than [[Luxon faction]] points or have bribed the [[Kurzick Priest]] at that [[Resurrection Shrine]].

